Bonsai by Prism ML
The Shingi 27B weights (https://huggingface.co/kortexa-ai/shingi-27b) are
derived from prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf, revision
6ed5e12bf84b7a63069882c91dd9e9218647d17b, which is provided under Apache-2.0.
Created using Bonsai by Prism ML. The upstream notice credits Prism ML, Inc.
and the Qwen3.8-27B base from Alibaba Cloud. Shingi 27B keeps Bonsai's ternary
PQ2_0 weights and changes their per-block scales by training. Preserve Bonsai's
LICENSE and NOTICE.txt when redistributing the weights. No upstream author
endorses the resulting model.
Image input downloads and uses Bonsai's unchanged vision projector,
Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-mmproj-Q8_0.gguf from the same revision (Apache-2.0).
https://huggingface.co/prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf

Prism runtime / llama.cpp
run.sh builds the public PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp fork at
4fbda1292562cc1f23904d5867fb79603737547a from source.
Its code is MIT licensed, copyright 2023-2026 The ggml authors. No runtime
