third-party notices when redistributing its binaries.
https://github.com/PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp

OpenJev and TypeSafe
OpenJev's public helper and the TypeSafe system-one adapter informed Shingi's
letter scoring, chunk-and-anchor composition, confidence formulas, and HTTP
interface. OpenJev explicitly licenses helper/ under Apache-2.0; the TypeSafe
adapter is MIT licensed (Copyright 2026 TypeSafe AI):
https://huggingface.co/openjev/openjev/blob/5ec9e5fd2f80a6fff386779b1e5ac7e389971889/helper/shim.py
https://github.com/typesafe-ai/system-one-adapter-python/tree/adffc2eab300a4fa3c0e92252d4ffd6ceaa53700
No OpenJev weights are included. This is an independent project.

